    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dreamcore Retro is a low poly indie game with a PSX feel based on lucid dreaming and liminal spaces to concern about endangered species and other problems from the future society. The game mainly consists in exploring the dreamy surroundings of these psychedelic and minimalistic worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dreamcore Retro is a surrealist first-person walking simulator game about dreams, featuring</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* trippy, psychedelic visuals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* intense music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* platforms</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* and last but not least, an overarching feeling of NEVER knowing what to expect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a dreamy and psychedelic  world through low poly enviroments and liminal spaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It explores the idea of a mind losing its grasp with reality, as reality turns into a dream. Often it resembles an acid trip, or an interactive fever dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Retro game influenced by the DREAMCORE Aesthetic with a PSX feel. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combining a Walking Simulator with Platforms, and trippy music, be prepared to confront your deepest thoughts in this mental challenge between dreams and reality where nothing is what it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A TOTAL experience.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dreamcore Retro is a low poly indie game with a PSX feel based on lucid dreaming and liminal spaces to concern about endangered species and other problems from the future society. The game mainly consists in exploring the dreamy surroundings of these psychedelic and minimalistic worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dreamcore Retro is a surrealist first-person walking simulator game about dreams, featuring</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* trippy, psychedelic visuals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* intense music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* platforms</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* and last but not least, an overarching feeling of NEVER knowing what to expect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a dreamy and psychedelic  world through low poly enviroments and liminal spaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It explores the idea of a mind losing its grasp with reality, as reality turns into a dream. Often it resembles an acid trip, or an interactive fever dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Retro game influenced by the DREAMCORE Aesthetic with a PSX feel. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combining a Walking Simulator with Platforms, and trippy music, be prepared to confront your deepest thoughts in this mental challenge between dreams and reality where nothing is what it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A TOTAL experience.</p>",
